WEBVTT

01:04:30.011 --> 01:04:32.517
We survived because
we're really good at cooperation.

01:04:32.541 --> 01:04:35.368
And the first time the tigers
came to get us, they ate us,

01:04:35.392 --> 01:04:38.353
but the second time,
we figured out ways to fight them off.

01:04:38.377 --> 01:04:40.217
CA: But, if that was so,

01:04:40.241 --> 01:04:45.526
you would think that people would know
that being generous to others

01:04:45.550 --> 01:04:46.737
would give them joy.

01:04:46.761 --> 01:04:49.623
Most people don't know that.
They don't even think about it.

01:04:49.647 --> 01:04:53.582
It's not on their menu of possibility
to really focus a huge effort.

01:04:53.606 --> 01:04:57.965
DB: Well, first, we're supremely broken,
but we're also splendidly endowed.

01:04:57.989 --> 01:04:59.157
We have both things.

01:04:59.181 --> 01:05:01.278
But I would say
our culture has messed us up.